<p> -Beef and Veal	    -0.7   -0.8	1.0</p>
<p> -Pork			 -1.1    0.1	9.2</p>
<p> -Poultry (Unadjusted)   -1.0   -0.2	5.6</p>
<p> -Fresh Fruits		1.4    1.3	5.9</p>
